                        <support>
                           <p>Script: dpe tshugs.<lb/>Missing folio: 5, 13b.<lb/>Orthographic particularities: ya-btags, da-drags, alternance of prefixes (rngos po, dngos po), and the particle pa/ba taking the form ba after final n.<lb/>A few glosses are found on the manuscript, some of which report opinions (…zer).</p>
