               </history>
               <additional>
                  <adminInfo>
                     <availability>
                        <p>available</p>
                     </availability>
                     <note type="comment">This incomplete manuscript can be identified as No. 16378 in [8H6M69W4], which reports 79 folios, only 34 of which appear in [KUYBGM7V].&#13;
As noted in the erratum to [J4L5X9AG], the text in this manuscript corresponds to the portion of Dharmottara's Pramāṇaviniścayaṭīkā (ID:5594), chapter 3, covering fols. 1a-32b in D4227 (with missing portions since fol. 5 and the reproduction of fol. 13 are missing). The version of the text in this manuscript does not significantly differ from that canonical version.</note>
                  </adminInfo>
