MH4T]: 193 for the main events of his life.&#13;
&#13;
Three manuscript editions of his writings and translations were deposited respectively in rNgog Blo ldan shes rab's tomb, in the monastery of gSang phu (probably in the main assembly hall), and in Drin las kyi sde (ID:4357) ([7FZ3B926]: 107).</note></person><person xml:id="person3798"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">parahitabhadra</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">gzhan la phan pa bzang po</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pa ra hi ta</persName><birth notBefore="1000-01-01" notAfter="1060-12-31">after 1000 before 1060</birth><death notBefore="1080-01-01" notAfter="1140-12-31">after 1080 before 1140</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P8225</idno><idno type="APIS">3798</idno></person><person xml:id="person4006"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rigs pa'i ral gri</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">རིགས་པའི་རལ་གྲི</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dar ma rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos kyi rgyal mtshan</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan rigs pa'i ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rig pa'i ral gri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bcom ldan rigs ral</persName><birth notBefore="1227-01-01" notAfter="1227-12-31">1227</birth><death notBefore="1305-08-29" notAfter="1305-08-29">1305-08-29</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P1217</idno><idno type="APIS">4006</idno><note type="comment">On his career, see [KHA9ZVGP]: 3-8.&#13;
The dates 1227-1305 are known from the biography (see work (ID:7016)) composed by his student bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).&#13;
His name in religion was Dar ma rgyal mtshan or Chos kyi rgyal mtshan ([FZ6N88AU]: 406) - the name Chos kyi rgyal mtshan is given as his "real name" (mtshan dngos) in a homage by Rong ston ([KM47ZZDJ]: 657 and n. 62). &#13;
The majority of the colophons of his works name him "bCom ldan ral gri," a few "Rigs/Rig pa’i ral gri" or just "Ral gri." Schwabland's discussion of the variants “Rigs pa” and “Rig pa” does not come to a definite conclusion as to which is the correct spelling ([CTQMVBPR]: 2-3).&#13;
He was born as the son of a local wealthy headman, the fourth of five sons and his birth is reported to have been foretold by Śākyaśrībhadra (ID:6418) when he was invited by Ral gri's paternal uncle ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).</note></person><person xml:id="person5534"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">vinītadeva</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dul ba lha</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">slob dpon dul pa'i lha</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dul lha</persName><birth notBefore="0700-01-01">after 700</birth><death notAfter="0780-12-31">before 780</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P0RK1701</idno><idno type="APIS">5534</idno><note type="comment">Proposed life dates: ca. 710-770 (see [AAIEJBMW]).</note></person><person xml:id="person5605"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">yamāri</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jamāri</persName><birth notBefore="1000-01-01">after 1000</birth><death notAfter="1060-12-31">before 1060</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P9949</idno><idno type="APIS">5605</idno><note type="comment">Proposed life dates: middle of the 11th century, 1000-1060 (see [AAIEJBMW]).</note></person><person xml:id="person5983"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">zhang zhung chos dbang grags pa</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཞང་ཞུང་ཆོས་དབང་གྲགས་པ</persName><birth notBefore="1404-01-01" notAfter="1404-12-31">1404</birth><death notBefore="1469-01-01" notAfter="1471-12-31">after 1469 before 1471</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="BDRC">https://purl.bdrc.io/resource/P4341</idno><idno type="APIS">5983</idno></person><person xml:id="person6607"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">dbang phyug rdo rje</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">དབང་ཕྱུག་རྡོ་རྗེ</persName><birth notBefore="1145-01-01" notAfter="1145-12-31">1145</birth><death notBefore="1206-01-01" notAfter="1206-12-31">1206</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">6607</idno><note type="comment">Mentioned by rTa tshag Tshe dbang rgyal in his 1447 ecclesiastic history (see [FEHIEFEB]: 122, who suggests the dates "ca. 1145-?1206").</note></person><person xml:id="person7819"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">devabala</persName><birth notBefore="0900-01-01">after 900</birth><death notAfter="1000-12-31">before 1000</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Indic</nationality><idno type="APIS">7819</idno><note type="comment">Junior to Dharmottara (ID:3780), living around the 10th century ([2M3IJFBS]: 241).</note></person></listPerson><listBibl><bibl xml:id="work3774"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pramāṇaviniścaya</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam par nges pa</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam nges</title><date type="composition" notBefore="0560-01-01" notAfter="0660-12-31">after 560 before 660</date><author ref="person:3773">dharmakīrti</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3774</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work3779"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">nyāyabinduṭīkā</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rigs pa'i thigs pa'i rgya cher 'grel ba</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">bam po lnga pa</title><date type="composition" notBefore="0750-01-01" notAfter="0800-12-31">after 750 before 800</date><author ref="person:3780">dharmottara</author><note type="isExtant">True</note><idno type="APIS">3779</idno></bibl><bibl xml:id="work5594"><title type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">pramāṇaviniścayaṭīkā (1)</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">tshad ma rnam par nges pa'i 'grel bshad 'thad ldan</title><title type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">chos mchog chen po</title><date type="compos